original version of this article contained an error. The concentration for PIP2 used to attenuate rundown should have been written as 0.3 &#x003bc;M, not 3 &#x003bc;M.</p><p>In Materials and Methods, p. 206, under the section &#x0201c;Electrophysiology,&#x0201d; &#x0201c;3 &#x003bc;M PIP2 in the intracellular solution&#x0201d; should read &#x0201c;0.3 &#x003bc;M PIP2 in the intracellular solution.&#x0201d;</p></body></article>